	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(-199.82947785855913, 519.4705882352939, 410.0, 76.0)" font-family=".AppleSystemUIFont" font-size="16">WDBC dataset: 569 observation, 30 continuous morphological features, diagnosis as target, ID excluded from modelling. Dataset contains no missing values</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(438.5964912280705, 825.3684210526314, 500.877192982456, 91.73684210526335)" font-family=".AppleSystemUIFont" font-size="16">Seven strandard classifiers evaluated using stratified 10-fold cross validation. Sandardization was performed inside each training fold to prevent data leakage. Performance was assessef primarily using AUC and malignant class recall</text>
		<text id="2" type="text/plain" rect="(-96.0, -874.0, 336.0, 68.0)" font-family=".AppleSystemUIFont" font-size="16">Diagnosis was hidden as metadata and was not used to construct the clusters. It was retained only for comparison later</text>
		<text id="3" type="text/plain" rect="(274.0, -1298.0, 354.0, 83.0)" font-family=".AppleSystemUIFont" font-size="16">Pairwise distances were calculated between observations using normalized Euclidean distance. Diagnosis was excluded from the distance calculation</text>
	</annotations>
